ight="300" /></p><hr /><h2 data-start="119" data-end="161"><strong data-start="123" data-end="159">Especificaciones principales del fosfato dicálcico 17%</strong></h2><div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div class="group w-fit _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="163" data-end="639"><thead data-start="163" data-end="204"><tr data-start="163" data-end="204"><th data-start="163" data-end="175" data-col-size="md">Parámetro</th><th data-start="175" data-end="186" data-col-size="sm">Estándar</th><th data-start="186" data-end="204" data-col-size="sm">Resultado del producto</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="248" data-end="639"><tr data-start="248" data-end="290"><td data-start="248" data-end="271" data-col-size="md">Fósforo total (P)</td><td data-start="271" data-end="280" data-col-size="sm">≥17.0%</td><td data-start="280" data-end="290" data-col-size="sm">17.20%</td></tr><tr data-start="291" data-end="356"><td data-start="291" data-end="342" data-col-size="md">Fósforo disponible (solubilidad en ácido cítrico 2%)</td><td data-start="342" data-end="349" data-col-size="sm">≥90%</td><td data-start="349" data-end="356" data-col-size="sm">97%</td></tr><tr data-start="357" data-end="389"><td data-start="357" data-end="372" data-col-size="md">Calcio (Ca)</td><td data-start="372" data-end="379" data-col-size="sm">≥20%</td><td data-start="379" data-end="389" data-col-size="sm">22.44%</td></tr><tr data-start="390" data-end="423"><td data-start="390" data-end="405" data-col-size="md">Flúor (F)</td><td data-start="405" data-end="414" data-col-size="sm">≤0.18%</td><td data-start="414" data-end="423" data-col-size="sm">0.15%</td></tr><tr data-start="424" data-end="458"><td data-start="424" data-end="439" data-col-size="md">Arsénico (As)</td><td data-start="439" data-end="449" data-col-size="sm">≤15 ppm</td><td data-start="449" data-end="458" data-col-size=